# .gitignore for Vulkanium
# Gradle + Java + Minecraft mod development defaults

### Build / dependency caches
.gradle/
**/build/
build/
out/

### Gradle wrapper (keep the wrapper files committed) — do NOT ignore gradle/wrapper/

### IDEs / editors
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

### OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### Logs / crash reports / temp
*.log
hs_err_pid*
crash-reports/
logs/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.temp

### Editor swap / backup files
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.#*

### Node / frontend
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log
/dist/

### Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/

### Test / coverage reports
coverage/
jacoco.exec
*.lcov
reports/

### Local configs / secrets
local.properties
.env
.env.*
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12

### Misc
hs_err_pid*
*.class
*.log

### Project-specific: development run directory (Minecraft run dir)
/run/
/run/**

# If you want to ignore compiled shader blobs add: *.spv
# If you want to keep certain generated files committed, add explicit "!pattern" entries below
